<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 3.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 3.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				 Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Villa World	    10.58    1.04</p>
<p> 2   Schroder Intl	  10.15    2.37</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	10.00    0.98</p>
